# Dashboard

Synced {{ as_of }}. Filters: {{ filters }}.

## Shortlist

```dataview
TABLE rank, ev_ebit AS "EV/EBIT", net_cash_to_mcap AS "Net cash/mcap", fcf_yield AS "FCF yield", drawdown_52w AS "Below high", insider_buy_90d_usd AS "Insider buys 90d", flags
FROM "Companies"
WHERE status = "shortlist"
SORT rank ASC
```

## Quarantined (passes the filters it can be checked on; data missing or suspect)

```dataview
TABLE ev_ebit AS "EV/EBIT", insider_buy_90d_usd AS "Insider buys 90d", issues
FROM "Companies"
WHERE status = "quarantine"
SORT insider_buy_90d_usd DESC
```

## New insider buys (filed in the last 30 days)

```dataview
TABLE date, company, insider, usd AS "Value"
FROM "Events"
WHERE type = "insider_buy" AND filed >= date(today) - dur(30 days)
SORT filed DESC
```

## Reviews due

```dataview
TABLE ticker, decision, review_date AS "Review date", thesis
FROM "Journal"
WHERE type = "journal" AND review_date AND review_date <= date(today)
SORT review_date ASC
```

